<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="DrugCalc">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0f18" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f0f3fa" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<title>DrugCalc — Anestesia & UTI</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0d0f18;
  --surface: #161924;
  --card: #1e2235;
  --border: #2a2f4a;
  --accent: #4d8ef7;
  --green: #35c47a;
  --yellow: #f4c430;
  --red: #e05050;
  --orange: #f08040;
  --purple: #8b68d4;
  --teal: #3bbfc4;
  --text: #eaecf5;
  --muted: #7a85a0;
  --r: 14px;
  --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  --safe-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  --nav-bg: rgba(13,15,24,0.96);
  --topbar-bg: rgba(13,15,24,0.92);
  --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
  :root {
    --bg: #f0f3fa;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --border: #d8ddf0;
    --accent: #2d72e8;
    --green: #1f9e5f;
    --yellow: #b58a00;
    --red: #c83232;
    --orange: #c0601a;
    --purple: #6b46c1;
    --teal: #0e8f95;
    --text: #0f1220;
    --muted: #5a6480;
    --nav-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
    --topbar-bg: rgba(240,243,250,0.94);
    --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
html, body { height: 100%; }
body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Display', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  padding-top: var(--safe-top);
}

/* ── TOP BAR ── */
.topbar {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  top: var(--safe-top);
  z-index: 100;
  background: var(--topbar-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 14px 18px 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.topbar h1 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
.topbar h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
.topbar .sub { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); }
.about-btn { background: none; border: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.4rem; min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; }

/* ── ABOUT ── */
#about {
  margin: auto; max-width: 320px;
  background: var(--card); color: var(--text);
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r);
  padding: 20px; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.85rem;
}
#about::backdrop { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
#about h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
#about p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
#about a { color: var(--accent); }
#about .about-note { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }
#about button { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: none; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; }

/* ── PATIENT PANEL ── */
.patient-panel {
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 14px 16px;
}
.patient-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
}
.patient-row-2 {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}
.imc-box {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 6px;
}
.imc-val {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}
.imc-label {
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 2px 7px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  border: 1px solid;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.imc-normal { color: var(--green); border-color: rgba(53,196,122,0.35); background: rgba(53,196,122,0.08); }
.imc-low    { color: var(--accent); border-color: rgba(77,142,247,0.35); background: rgba(77,142,247,0.08); }
.imc-over   { color: var(--yellow); border-color: rgba(244,196,48,0.35); background: rgba(244,196,48,0.08); }
.imc-obese  { color: var(--orange); border-color: rgba(240,128,64,0.35); background: rgba(240,128,64,0.08); }
.imc-mobese { color: var(--red); border-color: rgba(224,80,80,0.35); background: rgba(224,80,80,0.08); }

/* sex toggle */
.sex-toggle {
  display: flex;
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  height: 40px;
}
.sex-btn {
  flex: 1;
  border: none;
  background: none;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.sex-btn.active { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

/* weight grid */
.weight-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 10px;
}
.wbox {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  text-align: center;
}
.wbox-label {
  font-size: 0.58rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.wbox-val {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}
.wbox-unit { font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
.wbox.active-w { border-color: rgba(77,142,247,0.5); }

/* weight type badge on drug cards */
.wtype-badge {
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: rgba(77,142,247,0.1);
  color: var(--accent);
  border: 1px solid rgba(77,142,247,0.25);
  margin-left: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}
.field label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.6px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.field input, .field select {
  width: 100%;
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  outline: none;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  transition: border-color 0.15s;
}
.field input:focus, .field select:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
.field select option { background: var(--card); }
.badge-weight {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 9px 12px;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--accent);
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}
.badge-weight small { font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; margin-left: 3px; }

/* ── TABS (bottom nav) ── */
.bottom-nav {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0; right: 0;
  padding-bottom: var(--safe-bottom);
  background: var(--nav-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  display: flex;
  overflow-x: auto;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  z-index: 100;
}
.bottom-nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.nav-btn {
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 10px 1px 8px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3px;
  transition: color 0.15s;
}
.nav-btn .icon { font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1; }
.nav-btn.active { color: var(--accent); }
@media (max-width: 340px) { .nav-btn { font-size: 0.52rem; } }

/* ── CONTENT ── */
.content {
  padding: 16px 14px;
  padding-bottom: calc(72px + var(--safe-bottom) + 16px);
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.tab-pane { display: none; }
.tab-pane.active { display: block; }

/* ── SECTION HEADER ── */
.sec-hdr {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1.4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin: 20px 0 10px 4px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.sec-hdr::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  width: 3px;
  height: 14px;
  background: var(--accent);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ── DRUG CARD ── */
.drug-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--r);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.drug-header {
  padding: 14px 16px 10px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
}
.drug-name {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.3px;
}
.drug-subtitle {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 2px;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.drug-conc {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* mode toggle */
.mode-toggle {
  display: flex;
  margin: 0 14px 12px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 3px;
  gap: 3px;
}
.mode-btn {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 6px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: none;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.mode-btn.active {
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

/* dose table */
.dose-table {
  padding: 0 14px 14px;
}
.dose-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 8px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}
.dose-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.dose-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
.score-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 0; font-size: 0.82rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
.score-row input { width: 20px; height: 20px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
.hid-input { width: 70px; background: var(--surface); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; color: var(--text); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 8px; outline: none; text-align: right; }
.dose-val {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.3px;
}
.dose-unit { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 2px; }

/* infusion table */
.inf-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}
.inf-table th {
  padding: 6px 8px;
  text-align: left;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.inf-table td {
  padding: 7px 8px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.035);
  color: var(--text);
}
.inf-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.inf-table .hl { font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.inf-table .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.72rem; }

.dilution-note {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 0 14px 12px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.dilution-note strong { color: var(--text); }

.badges {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 0 14px 12px;
}
.badge {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid;
}
.bg { background: rgba(53,196,122,0.1); color: var(--green); border-color: rgba(53,196,122,0.25); }
.bw { background: rgba(244,196,48,0.1); color: var(--yellow); border-color: rgba(244,196,48,0.25); }
.br { background: rgba(224,80,80,0.1); color: var(--red); border-color: rgba(224,80,80,0.25); }
.bi { background: rgba(77,142,247,0.1); color: var(--accent); border-color: rgba(77,142,247,0.25); }

/* PCR */
.pcr-card {
  background: rgba(224,80,80,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(224,80,80,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--r);
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.pcr-title {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--red);
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}
.pcr-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 6px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  gap: 12px;
}
.pcr-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.pcr-l { color: var(--muted); flex-shrink: 0; }
.pcr-v { font-weight: 700; text-align: right; }

/* disclaimer */
.disclaimer {
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  background: rgba(244,196,48,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(244,196,48,0.15);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-align: center;
}

.no-weight {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 20px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.88rem;
}
.no-weight .icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: 0.4; }

/* ── VOLATILE CALCULATOR ── */
#tab-vol .v-agent-tabs {
  display: flex; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 0 12px;
  overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;
}
#tab-vol .v-agent-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
#tab-vol .v-tab-btn {
  font-size: 12px; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border); background: transparent;
  color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
  font-family: inherit; flex-shrink: 0; transition: all .15s;
}
#tab-vol .v-tab-btn.active { background: rgba(77,142,247,0.12); border-color: rgba(77,142,247,.3); color: var(--accent); }
#tab-vol .v-card {
  background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--r); padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;
}
#tab-vol .v-card-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
#tab-vol .v-phase-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
#tab-vol .v-dot-sat { background: var(--yellow); }
#tab-vol .v-dot-man { background: var(--green); }
#tab-vol .v-dot-cfg { background: var(--accent); }
#tab-vol .v-card-header h2 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; flex: 1; color: var(--text); }
#tab-vol .v-badge { font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 20px; }
#tab-vol .v-badge-sat { background: rgba(244,196,48,0.1); color: var(--yellow); border: 1px solid rgba(244,196,48,.25); }
#tab-vol .v-badge-man { background: rgba(53,196,122,0.1); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid rgba(53,196,122,.25); }
#tab-vol .v-badge-cfg { background: rgba(77,142,247,0.1); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid rgba(77,142,247,.25); }
#tab-vol .v-time-block {
  background: var(--surface); border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
#tab-vol .v-time-start-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
#tab-vol .v-time-start-row label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); flex-shrink: 0; }
#tab-vol .v-time-start-row input[type=time] {
  background: transparent; border: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--text); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;
  font-family: 'SF Mono', monospace; padding: 2px 4px;
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 110px;
}
#tab-vol .v-time-start-row input[type=time]::-webkit-calendar-picker-indicator { filter: invert(.5); cursor: pointer; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-slider-wrap { position: relative; padding-bottom: 20px; }
#tab-vol input.v-dur-slide {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 100%; height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; outline: none;
}
#tab-vol input.v-dur-slide.v-sat-ds {
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--yellow) 0%, var(--yellow) var(--pct,40%), var(--border) var(--pct,40%), var(--border) 100%);
}
#tab-vol input.v-dur-slide.v-sat-ds::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--yellow); cursor: pointer; border: 4px solid var(--card);
}
#tab-vol input.v-dur-slide.v-man-ds {
  background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--green) 0%, var(--green) var(--pct,17%), var(--border) var(--pct,17%), var(--border) 100%);
}
#tab-vol input.v-dur-slide.v-man-ds::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green); cursor: pointer; border: 4px solid var(--card);
}
#tab-vol .v-dur-ticks { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
#tab-vol .v-time-result { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 14px; }
#tab-vol .v-end-block { text-align: center; }
#tab-vol .v-end-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2px; }
#tab-vol .v-end-time { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'SF Mono', monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1; }
#tab-vol .v-arrow { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); padding: 0 4px; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-block { text-align: center; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2px; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-val { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-input { width: 2.6em; font: inherit; color: inherit; text-align: center; background: none; border: none; border-bottom: 1.5px dashed var(--border); padding: 0; -moz-appearance: textfield; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button, #tab-vol .v-dur-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance: none; }
#tab-vol .v-dur-input:focus { outline: none; border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
#tab-vol .v-dur-unit { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 2px; }
#tab-vol .v-slider-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
#tab-vol .v-slider-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
#tab-vol .v-slider-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 5px; }
#tab-vol input[type=range]:not(.v-dur-slide) {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 100%; height: 3px;
  border-radius: 2px; background: var(--border); outline: none;
}
#tab-vol .v-sat-range::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--yellow); cursor: pointer; border: 3px solid var(--card);
}
#tab-vol .v-man-range::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green); cursor: pointer; border: 3px solid var(--card);
}
#tab-vol .v-cfg-range::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  -webkit-appearance: none; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; border: 3px solid var(--card);
}
#tab-vol .v-slider-val { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; min-width: 72px; text-align: right; }
#tab-vol .v-sat-val { color: var(--yellow); }
#tab-vol .v-man-val { color: var(--green); }
#tab-vol .v-total-val { color: var(--accent); }
#tab-vol .v-metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
#tab-vol .v-metric { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 7px; text-align: center; }
#tab-vol .v-metric-val { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 3px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tab-vol .v-metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.3; }
#tab-vol .v-total-card {
  background: rgba(77,142,247,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(77,142,247,.2);
  border-radius: var(--r); padding: 14px 16px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
#tab-vol .v-total-number { font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tab-vol .v-total-meta p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 3px; }
#tab-vol .v-total-meta strong { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text); }
#tab-vol .v-split-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
#tab-vol .v-split-item { border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; }
#tab-vol .v-split-sat { background: rgba(244,196,48,0.1); }
#tab-vol .v-split-man { background: rgba(53,196,122,0.1); }
#tab-vol .v-s-label { font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
#tab-vol .v-s-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tab-vol .v-s-unit { font-size: 11px; }
#tab-vol .v-split-sat .v-s-label, #tab-vol .v-split-sat .v-s-val, #tab-vol .v-split-sat .v-s-unit { color: var(--yellow); }
#tab-vol .v-split-man .v-s-label, #tab-vol .v-split-man .v-s-val, #tab-vol .v-split-man .v-s-unit { color: var(--green); }
#tab-vol .v-factor-card {
  background: var(--surface); border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 9px 12px; margin-top: 8px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
}
#tab-vol .v-factor-card span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); flex: 1; }
#tab-vol .v-factor-val { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tab-vol .v-cfg-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
#tab-vol .v-cfg-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
#tab-vol .v-chart-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--r); padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
#tab-vol .v-chart-title { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }
#tab-vol .v-chart-title::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); }
#tab-vol .v-legend { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
#tab-vol .v-legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
#tab-vol .v-legend-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }
#tab-vol .v-warn {
  background: rgba(224,80,80,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(224,80,80,.25);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 8px; display: none;
}
#tab-vol .v-warn.visible { display: block; }
#tab-vol .v-footer {
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 4px;
  padding: 14px 0 4px; line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ── Infusão (js/infusion.js) ── */
#tab-inf .inf-pad { padding: 14px 16px 16px; }
#tab-inf .inf-label {
  font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.6px;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin: 12px 0 5px;
}
#tab-inf .inf-pad > .inf-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
#tab-inf .inf-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
#tab-inf .inf-sep { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
#tab-inf .inf-in, #tab-inf .inf-sel {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
  color: var(--text); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 10px;
  outline: none; min-width: 0; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
}
#tab-inf .inf-in { flex: 1; text-align: right; width: 100%; }
#tab-inf .inf-sel { flex: 0 0 auto; text-align: center; }
#tab-inf .inf-wide { width: 100%; display: block; }
#tab-inf .inf-big { font-size: 1.3rem; padding: 12px 14px; }
#tab-inf .inf-in:focus, #tab-inf .inf-sel:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
#tab-inf .inf-conc {
  margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;
}
#tab-inf .inf-seg {
  display: flex; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 3px; gap: 3px; margin-bottom: 4px;
}
#tab-inf .inf-chip {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px;
  color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 12px; cursor: pointer;
}
#tab-inf .inf-chip.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
#tab-inf .inf-hint { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.5; }
#tab-inf .inf-hint a { color: var(--accent); }
#tab-inf .inf-manage { margin-top: 12px; }
#tab-inf .inf-manage summary { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 0; }
#tab-inf .inf-btnrow { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
#tab-inf .inf-btnrow button {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px;
  color: var(--text); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 10px; cursor: pointer;
}
#tab-inf .inf-btnrow button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; }
#tab-inf .inf-result { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: var(--accent); }
#tab-inf .inf-result span { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
#tab-inf .inf-eq { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
#tab-inf .inf-eq b { color: var(--text); }
#tab-inf .inf-warn {
  margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--red);
  background: rgba(224,80,80,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(224,80,80,0.3);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px;
}
#tab-inf .inf-msg {
  font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--yellow); background: rgba(244,196,48,0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(244,196,48,0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
#tab-inf .inf-foot { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 6px 0 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div>
    <h1>💊 <span>DrugCalc</span></h1>
    <div class="sub">Anestesia · Urgência · UTI</div>
  </div>
  <button class="about-btn" onclick="document.getElementById('about').showModal()" aria-label="Sobre">ⓘ</button>
</div>

<dialog id="about">
  <h2>💊 DrugCalc</h2>
  <p>Calculadora de doses para anestesia, UTI e urgência.</p>
  <p>Desenvolvido por <a href="https://github.com/gpmachado" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@gpmachado</a> no GitHub.</p>
  <p class="about-note">Uso exclusivo por médico habilitado. Valores de referência — confira sempre com o protocolo institucional.</p>
  <form method="dialog"><button>Fechar</button></form>
</dialog>

<div class="patient-panel">
  <div class="patient-row">
    <div class="field">
      <label>Peso (kg)</label>
      <input type="number" id="weight" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="70" min="1" max="300" oninput="update()">
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label>Altura (cm)</label>
      <input type="number" id="height" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="170" min="50" max="250" oninput="update()">
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label>Sexo</label>
      <div class="sex-toggle">
        <button class="sex-btn active" id="sexM" onclick="setSex('M')">♂ M</button>
        <button class="sex-btn" id="sexF" onclick="setSex('F')">♀ F</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- IMC -->
  <div class="patient-row-2" style="margin-top:10px">
    <div class="field">
      <label>IMC</label>
      <div class="imc-box" id="imc-display">
        <span class="imc-val" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:500">—</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label>Idade</label>
      <input type="number" id="age" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="45" min="1" max="120" oninput="update()">
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Pesos -->
  <div class="weight-grid" id="weight-grid">
    <div class="wbox"><div class="wbox-label">Real (TBW)</div><div class="wbox-val" id="w-tbw" style="color:var(--text)">—<span class="wbox-unit"></span></div></div>
    <div class="wbox"><div class="wbox-label">Ideal (IBW)</div><div class="wbox-val" id="w-ibw" style="color:var(--green)">—<span class="wbox-unit"></span></div></div>
    <div class="wbox"><div class="wbox-label">Corrigido (ABW)</div><div class="wbox-val" id="w-abw" style="color:var(--orange)">—<span class="wbox-unit"></span></div></div>
    <div class="wbox"><div class="wbox-label">Magro (LBW)</div><div class="wbox-val" id="w-lbw" style="color:var(--purple)">—<span class="wbox-unit"></span></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="content">
  <div class="tab-pane active" id="tab-iot"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-sed"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-adj"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-vaso"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-inf"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-al"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-hid">
    <div class="sec-hdr">Hidratação Perioperatória</div>
    <div class="drug-card" style="margin-bottom:14px">
      <div class="drug-header"><div><div class="drug-name" style="color:var(--accent)">Dados do Paciente</div>
      <div class="drug-subtitle">Jejum e hematócrito</div></div></div>
      <div class="dose-table">
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Tempo de jejum</span><span class="dose-val">
          <input type="number" id="jejum" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="8" min="0" max="24" oninput="renderHid()"><span class="dose-unit"> h</span></span></div>
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Ht inicial</span><span class="dose-val">
          <input type="number" id="ht-i" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="40" min="10" max="70" oninput="renderHid()"><span class="dose-unit"> %</span></span></div>
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Ht mínimo aceitável</span><span class="dose-val">
          <input type="number" id="ht-f" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="21" min="10" max="70" oninput="renderHid()"><span class="dose-unit"> %</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="hid-out"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-pcr"></div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-lab">
    <div class="sec-hdr">Exames — Hemograma por idade</div>
    <div class="drug-card">
      <div class="drug-header"><div><div class="drug-name" style="color:var(--red)">Hb / Ht</div>
      <div class="drug-subtitle">Limite inferior por idade (Nathan &amp; Oski / Harriet Lane; adulto OMS)</div></div></div>
      <div class="dose-table">
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Idade</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-age" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="anos" oninput="renderLab()"> <select id="lab-age-u" class="hid-input" style="width:auto" onchange="renderLab()"><option value="365">anos</option><option value="30.4">meses</option><option value="1">dias</option></select></span></div>
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Hb</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-hb" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="12" oninput="renderLab()"><span class="dose-unit"> g/dL</span></span></div>
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Ht</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-ht" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="36" oninput="renderLab()"><span class="dose-unit"> %</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div id="lab-hb-out"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-hdr">Função renal (adulto)</div>
    <div class="drug-card">
      <div class="drug-header"><div><div class="drug-name" style="color:var(--accent)">Filtração Glomerular</div>
      <div class="drug-subtitle">CKD-EPI 2021 (sem raça) · Cockcroft-Gault · idade, sexo e peso do painel</div></div></div>
      <div class="dose-table">
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Creatinina</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-cr" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="1.0" oninput="renderLab()"><span class="dose-unit"> mg/dL</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div id="lab-cr-out"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-hdr">Metabolismo (adulto)</div>
    <div class="drug-card">
      <div class="drug-header"><div><div class="drug-name" style="color:var(--orange)">HOMA</div>
      <div class="drug-subtitle">Resistência insulínica e função de célula β (jejum)</div></div></div>
      <div class="dose-table">
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Glicemia</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-gli" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="90" oninput="renderLab()"><span class="dose-unit"> mg/dL</span></span></div>
        <div class="dose-row"><span class="dose-label">Insulina</span><span class="dose-val"><input type="number" id="lab-ins" class="hid-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="10" oninput="renderLab()"><span class="dose-unit"> µU/mL</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div id="lab-homa-out"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-vol">

    <!-- Agent tabs -->
    <div class="v-agent-tabs">
      <button class="v-tab-btn active" onclick="volSetAgent('sevo',this)">Sevorane</button>
      <button class="v-tab-btn" onclick="volSetAgent('iso',this)">Isoflurano</button>
      <button class="v-tab-btn" onclick="volSetAgent('des',this)">Desflurano</button>
      <button class="v-tab-btn" onclick="volSetAgent('halo',this)">Halotano</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Config -->
    <div class="v-card">
      <div class="v-card-header">
        <div class="v-phase-dot v-dot-cfg"></div>
        <h2>Configuração física</h2>
        <span class="v-badge v-badge-cfg">fórmula real</span>
      </div>
      <div class="v-cfg-row">
        <div class="v-cfg-label">Temperatura sala (°C)</div>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
          <input type="range" class="v-cfg-range" id="vol-temp" min="15" max="30" step="1" value="20" style="width:100px;" oninput="volCalc()">
          <span class="v-slider-val v-total-val"><span id="vol-temp-v">20</span>°C</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-factor-card">
        <span>Fator de vaporização (lei dos gases):</span>
        <span class="v-factor-val">1 mL → <span id="vol-factor-v">184</span> mL vapor</span>
      </div>
      <div class="v-factor-card" style="margin-top:8px">
        <span>1 CAM ajustada p/ idade (<span id="vol-age">40</span> anos):</span>
        <span class="v-factor-val"><span id="vol-mac">1.80</span>%</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Saturação -->
    <div class="v-card">
      <div class="v-card-header">
        <div class="v-phase-dot v-dot-sat"></div>
        <h2>Saturação / indução</h2>
        <span class="v-badge v-badge-sat">FGF alto</span>
      </div>
      <div class="v-time-block">
        <div class="v-time-start-row">
          <label>Início</label>
          <input type="time" id="vol-s-start" value="08:00" onchange="volCalc()">
        </div>
        <div class="v-dur-slider-wrap">
          <input type="range" class="v-dur-slide v-sat-ds" id="vol-s-dur-slide"
                 min="1" max="30" step="1" value="5" style="--pct:13.3%" oninput="document.getElementById('vol-s-dur-val').value=this.value;volCalc()">
          <div class="v-dur-ticks">
            <span>1min</span><span>5</span><span>10</span><span>15</span><span>20</span><span>25</span><span>30min</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="v-time-result">
          <div class="v-end-block">
            <div class="v-end-label">início</div>
            <div class="v-end-time v-sat-val" id="vol-s-display-start">08:00</div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="v-end-block">
            <div class="v-end-label">fim estimado</div>
            <div class="v-end-time v-sat-val" id="vol-s-end-display">08:05</div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-arrow">=</div>
          <div class="v-dur-block">
            <div class="v-dur-label">duração</div>
            <div class="v-dur-val v-sat-val"><input type="number" class="v-dur-input" id="vol-s-dur-val" value="5" min="1" max="1440" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Duração em minutos" oninput="document.getElementById('vol-s-dur-slide').value=this.value;volCalc()"><span class="v-dur-unit">min</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-slider-group">
        <div class="v-slider-row">
          <div>
            <div class="v-slider-label">Concentração</div>
            <input type="range" class="v-sat-range" id="vol-s-conc" min="1" max="8" step="0.5" value="6" oninput="volCalc()">
          </div>
          <div class="v-slider-val v-sat-val"><span id="vol-s-conc-v">6.0</span>% <small id="vol-s-mac"></small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v-slider-row">
          <div>
            <div class="v-slider-label">FGF (L/min)</div>
            <input type="range" class="v-sat-range" id="vol-s-flow" min="1" max="8" step="0.1" value="4" oninput="volCalc()">
          </div>
          <div class="v-slider-val v-sat-val"><span id="vol-s-flow-v">4.0</span> L/min</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-metrics">
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-sat-val" id="vol-s-ml">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">mL líquido</div></div>
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-sat-val" id="vol-s-vap">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">L vapor</div></div>
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-sat-val" id="vol-s-rate">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">mL/hora</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Manutenção -->
    <div class="v-card">
      <div class="v-card-header">
        <div class="v-phase-dot v-dot-man"></div>
        <h2>Manutenção</h2>
        <span class="v-badge v-badge-man">FGF reduzido</span>
      </div>
      <div class="v-time-block">
        <div class="v-time-start-row">
          <label>Início</label>
          <input type="time" id="vol-m-start" value="08:05" onchange="volCalc()">
        </div>
        <div class="v-dur-slider-wrap">
          <input type="range" class="v-dur-slide v-man-ds" id="vol-m-dur-slide"
                 min="5" max="720" step="5" value="60" style="--pct:7.6%" oninput="document.getElementById('vol-m-dur-val').value=this.value;volCalc()">
          <div class="v-dur-ticks">
            <span>5min</span><span>2h</span><span>4h</span><span>6h</span><span>8h</span><span>10h</span><span>12h</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="v-time-result">
          <div class="v-end-block">
            <div class="v-end-label">início</div>
            <div class="v-end-time v-man-val" id="vol-m-display-start">08:05</div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="v-end-block">
            <div class="v-end-label">fim estimado</div>
            <div class="v-end-time v-man-val" id="vol-m-end-display">09:05</div>
          </div>
          <div class="v-arrow">=</div>
          <div class="v-dur-block">
            <div class="v-dur-label">duração</div>
            <div class="v-dur-val v-man-val"><input type="number" class="v-dur-input" id="vol-m-dur-val" value="60" min="1" max="1440" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Duração em minutos" oninput="document.getElementById('vol-m-dur-slide').value=this.value;volCalc()"><span class="v-dur-unit">min</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-slider-group">
        <div class="v-slider-row">
          <div>
            <div class="v-slider-label">Concentração</div>
            <input type="range" class="v-man-range" id="vol-m-conc" min="0.5" max="5" step="0.5" value="2" oninput="volCalc()">
          </div>
          <div class="v-slider-val v-man-val"><span id="vol-m-conc-v">2.0</span>% <small id="vol-m-mac"></small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v-slider-row">
          <div>
            <div class="v-slider-label">FGF (L/min)</div>
            <input type="range" class="v-man-range" id="vol-m-flow" min="0.5" max="4" step="0.1" value="1.5" oninput="volCalc()">
          </div>
          <div class="v-slider-val v-man-val"><span id="vol-m-flow-v">1.5</span> L/min</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-metrics">
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-man-val" id="vol-m-ml">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">mL líquido</div></div>
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-man-val" id="vol-m-vap">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">L vapor</div></div>
        <div class="v-metric"><div class="v-metric-val v-man-val" id="vol-m-rate">—</div><div class="v-metric-label">mL/hora</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Total -->
    <div class="v-total-card">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:5px;">total cirurgia</p>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;">
          <span class="v-total-number" id="vol-tot-all">—</span>
          <span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);">mL</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-total-meta">
        <p>duração total</p>
        <strong id="vol-tot-dur">—</strong>
        <p style="margin-top:6px;">agente</p>
        <strong id="vol-tot-agent">Sevorane</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="v-split-row">
      <div class="v-split-item v-split-sat">
        <div class="v-s-label">saturação</div>
        <div class="v-s-val" id="vol-tot-sat">—</div>
        <div class="v-s-unit">mL</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-split-item v-split-man">
        <div class="v-s-label">manutenção</div>
        <div class="v-s-val" id="vol-tot-man">—</div>
        <div class="v-s-unit">mL</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="v-warn" id="vol-warn-box">Consumo elevado (&gt;50 mL) — revise FGF e concentração se possível.</div>

    <!-- Chart -->
    <div class="v-chart-card">
      <div class="v-chart-title">consumo ao longo do tempo</div>
      <div style="position:relative;height:200px;">
        <canvas id="vol-chart"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="v-legend">
        <div class="v-legend-item"><div class="v-legend-dot" style="background:var(--yellow)"></div>Saturação</div>
        <div class="v-legend-item"><div class="v-legend-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></div>Manutenção</div>
        <div class="v-legend-item"><div class="v-legend-dot" style="background:var(--accent)"></div>Acumulado</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="v-footer">
      Fórmula: (d × 22400 × (273+T)) / (PM × 273)<br>
      Sevorane d=1,53 · PM=200 · fator≈184 mL/mL a 20°C<br>
      Estimativa · não substitui protocolo institucional
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<nav class="bottom-nav">
  <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="nav('iot',this)">
    <span class="icon">💉</span>IOT
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('sed',this)">
    <span class="icon">😴</span>Sedação
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('adj',this)">
    <span class="icon">🧪</span>Adjuv.
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('al',this)">
    <span class="icon">🔬</span>An.Local
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('vaso',this)">
    <span class="icon">💓</span>Vasoat.
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('inf',this)">
    <span class="icon">⏱️</span>Infusão
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('hid',this)">
    <span class="icon">💧</span>Hidrat.
  </button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="nav('pcr',this)">
